# Run output and scratch data are deliberately NOT tracked: this tree holds
# ~17 GB of solver results, provenance archives and reference datasets.
# Only the case setup, the sources and the written-up findings are versioned.
*
!.gitignore
!caseB/
!caseB/**
!HexMeshesTests/
!HexMeshesTests/src/
!HexMeshesTests/src/**
!HexMeshesTests/scripts/
!HexMeshesTests/scripts/**
!HexMeshesTests/debug_collaboration/
!HexMeshesTests/debug_collaboration/*.md
!HexMeshesTests/debug_collaboration/ensemble/
!HexMeshesTests/debug_collaboration/ensemble/*.py

# ...and inside caseB, never the run directories or logs
caseB/mesh[0-9]/
caseB/probeCase/
caseB/log.*
caseB/tmp/
caseB/foamCaseGraph/
caseB/**/.DS_Store
caseB/constant/*.withDefaultValues

# The case-local BC library is a build artefact: platform-specific, and stale
# the moment its source changes.  Build it instead -- see caseB/README.md.
caseB/lib/*.dylib
caseB/lib/*.so

# HexMeshesTests is a separate git repository, so it is not tracked from here
HexMeshesTests
HexMeshesTests/src/**/lnInclude/
HexMeshesTests/src/**/Make/*/
HexMeshesTests/scripts/__pycache__/
